    title: "Exploring the Best Medicare Advantage Leads Across Every Channel",
    metaTitle: "Exploring the Best Medicare Advantage Leads",
    excerpt: "An exploration of where the best Medicare Advantage leads come from across organic, paid, and referral channels.",
    metaDescription: "An exploration of where the best Medicare Advantage leads actually come from across organic, paid, and referral channels, and how to judge quality by source.",
    category: "Medicare Leads",
    readTime: "8 min read",
