    title: "Generate Medicare Leads With Native Advertising",
    metaTitle: "Generating Medicare Leads With Native Ads",
    excerpt: "How agents can use native advertising specifically to generate genuine Medicare lead interest.",
    metaDescription: "How agents can use native advertising to generate genuine Medicare lead interest, covering how this content-style ad format compares to standard display ads.",
